# ripgrep, fd and agent search tools: skip reference code by default.
# To search prior art on purpose: rg --no-ignore --hidden <pattern> .upstreamref/
/.upstreamref/
/docs/.archive/
# Vendor engines (docs/WORKFLOW.md section 5): upstream code is skipped; our adapters stay searchable.
# To search upstream on purpose: rg --no-ignore <pattern> services/<engine>/engine/
/services/bettafish/engine/**/*.*
/services/miroshark/engine/**/*.*
!/services/*/engine/**/asimog_*
!/services/*/engine/**/requirements-asimog.txt
!/services/*/engine/VENDOR.md
!/services/bettafish/engine/InsightEngine/tools/pumpfun_db.py
!/services/miroshark/engine/backend/wonderwall/simulations/pumpfun/*
